# Endpoint that receives lead submissions from /mentoria (ReplyCard.astro).
# Astro inlines PUBLIC_* vars at build time — this is public, never put a secret here.
#
# Works with either:
#   - a Google Apps Script Web App URL (see integracoes/mentoria-leads/README.md)
#   - a Make.com or n8n webhook URL
#
# Left empty, the form still degrades gracefully: submissions fail client-side
# and the visitor gets a mailto: link pre-filled with what they typed.
PUBLIC_LEADS_ENDPOINT=

# Optional shared value sent with every submission and checked by Code.gs.
# This is bundled into the public JS — it is a dumb-bot filter, not auth.
# Leave both blank, or set both to the same string.
PUBLIC_LEADS_TOKEN=
